    "text": "Good article and good points from Greg. Here’s another point of hypocrisy: Dems scream all day about toxic masculinity? Here’s a guy who exemplifies it pretty much exactly as they define it; and then they turn around and lavish praise on him, once more excusing or explaining all of it away for the sake of political expediency. No shame or remorse. And no admission that they’re full of it, ever.",
